{"created": "2026-01-12T07:38:17.735873+00:00", "modified": "2026-01-12T07:39:56.852331+00:00", "id": 18218776, "conceptrecid": "14430868", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18218776", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14430868", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18218776", "metadata": {"title": "Zero-shot Benchmarking of RNA Language Models in Structural, Functional, and Evolutionary Learning", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18218776", "publication_date": "2026-01-12", "description": "<p>Codes and datasets for RNA secondary structure prediction,zero-shot RNA classifications and &nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>zero-shot RNA fitness prediction.</div>\n</div>\n<p>Compared to previous versions: (1) The number of evaluated RNA language models has increased, while the evaluation of protein language models has been removed; (2) For structural tasks, the original TS set was refined through family-level deduplication to create TS-Hard; (3) For classification tasks, the Rfam dataset underwent sequence sampling (ensuring intra-family sequence similarity below 80%) to generate RfamSample, while the ArchiveII dataset was deduplicated by RNA type to produce ArchiveII-Nr; (4) A fitness prediction task was added, utilizing the DMS assays from RNAgym dataset.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Institute of Systems and Physical Biology, Shenzhen Bay Laboratory, Shenzhen 518107, China", "affiliation": null}], "contributors": [{"name": "Wang, He", "affiliation": "Institute of Systems and Physical Biology, Shenzhen Bay Laboratory, Shenzhen 518107, China", "type": null}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.18218776", "relation": "hasMetadata", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}], "dates": [{"type": "created", "description": "code and dataset"}, {"type": "updated", "description": "code and dataset"}], "version": "4", "references": ["RNA LMs; zero-shot secondary structure prediction; zero-shot RNA classification;zero-shot fitness prediction"], "res